{
    "name": "E2E IDeaS - send data",
    "description": "Sends one inventory date, one reservation and one group block with the three Send components and waits for the processing result of each on Done.",
    "notes": {
        "c708bf53-b0f4-44ac-b0a2-c30538846cb6": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 800,
            "width": 880,
            "height": 352,
            "content": "## Never run\n\nWritten from the IDeaS documentation; it has only passed `appmixer e2e validate`. No IDeaS test environment was available. See README.md in this folder.\n\n## Test data assumptions\n\n- The connection must point at an IDeaS **test** environment (Base URL and credentials issued by IDeaS for interim testing), never at a production property.\n- The room type `DBL`, the market segments `BAR` and `GRP`, the rate code `BAR` and the source `WEB` must exist in the configuration of the test property. Replace them with the codes IDeaS set up for it.\n- The asserts on **done** wait for IDeaS to post the processing result to the ReplyTo URL; AfterAll waits 15 minutes. IDeaS publishes no processing time.\n- Against the schema validation service (Base URL `https://api-mock-service.ideasrms.com`) the asserts on **out** pass and the ones on **done** time out: the mock never reports a result.\n- Nothing is cleaned up: the API has no delete. The reservation and the group keep fixed IDs, so every run updates the same records."
        }
    },
